%% Fatigue Detection Feedback Loop
flowchart LR
    User[User] --> SendSvc[Send Service]
    SendSvc --> SendEvent[Send Event<br/>(channel, type, ts)]
    SendEvent --> Counter[Per-User<br/>Rolling Counters<br/>(24h, 7d, 30d)]

    Counter --> Features[Feature Vector<br/>+ open rate, dismiss rate]
    Features --> ML[Fatigue ML Model<br/>(unsubscribe prob)]
    ML --> Decision{prob > 0.5?}

    Decision -- Yes --> Cap[Drop Marketing<br/>Keep Transactional]
    Decision -- No --> Allow[Send]

    User -. open / dismiss / unsubscribe .-> Counter
    Cap -. reduced noise .-> User
